{"summary":"在AcknowledgeLatch功能块中实现：fault为TRUE时alarm被强制置为TRUE并保持，优先于任何acknowledge边沿；fault为FALSE时，仅在acknowledge上升沿清alarm，否则保持。acknowledge上一扫描值在每个扫描周期无条件更新（包括fault有效期间），因此故障消失后仍按住的acknowledge不会清报警，必须先释放再按下。初始alarm=FALSE，acknowledge历史初值FALSE。","code":"FUNCTION_BLOCK AcknowledgeLatch
VAR_INPUT
    fault : BOOL;
    acknowledge : BOOL;
END_VAR
VAR_OUTPUT
    alarm : BOOL;
END_VAR
VAR
    ackPrev : BOOL;
    ackRising : BOOL;
END_VAR

(* 上升沿检测基于上一扫描的acknowledge值 *)
ackRising := acknowledge AND NOT ackPrev;

(* fault优先：只要故障存在就置位并保持报警 *)
IF fault THEN
    alarm := TRUE;
ELSIF ackRising THEN
    alarm := FALSE;
END_IF;

(* 每个扫描周期无条件更新历史，fault有效期间也更新 *)
ackPrev := acknowledge;

END_FUNCTION_BLOCK","assumptions":[]}
